<view class="page-body cache-page">
  <view class="summary-grid">
    <statistics-card label="缓存文件数" value="{{fileCountText}}" hint="个图片文件" />
    <statistics-card label="占用空间" value="{{sizeText}}" />
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">说明</view>
  <view class="card desc-card">
    <view class="desc-line">· 图片首次加载时自动下载到本地，后续优先读本地缓存。</view>
    <view class="desc-line">· 不做自动清理，可在此一键清空释放空间。</view>
    <view class="desc-line">· 清空后图片将回退为从网络加载。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="clear-btn {{clearing ? 'clear-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onClearTap">
    {{clearing ? '清理中…' : '一键清空缓存'}}
  </view>
</view>
